  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan comes upon the lotus at the end of a tunnel dug by the Flower Wine Monk. He is shocked to recognize it.",
        "chapters": [
          162
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "char_flower_wine_monk"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "A lotus image flickers above the spring water. When grabbed it is blue and white with its petals closed, looking like a lamp filled with a holy aura.",
        "chapters": [
          182
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "physical-descriptions",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Deep in the primeval sea it appears like an extremely small spirit spring.",
        "chapters": [
          187
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "physical-descriptions",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It is a blue and white lotus rooted in the aperture depths, with healthy plump petals and a holy aura.",
        "chapters": [
          202
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "physical-descriptions",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It is a bone-like white and blue flower that moves with the primeval sea currents.",
        "chapters": [
          273
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "physical-descriptions",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The rank five Heavenly Essence Treasure King Lotus is a blue and white lotus as large as a face, sealed in crystal.",
        "chapters": [
          558
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "physical-descriptions",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The rank nine Heavenly Essence Treasure Imperial Lotus still has jade green lotus leaves, bright and smooth, like a layer of glaze. At the center is a lotus flower bud. The petals are pure white and jade-like. It turns surrounding primeval energy into clear dew beads that flow along the glazed leaves into the bud. The white jade flower bud turns from white to pink, then to bright red. When the petals are fully red it blooms and shows a jade green lotus pod with eighty-one lotus seeds, each a yellow apricot immortal essence bead. After the beads are taken, the flower contracts and turns white again.",
        "chapters": [
          2235
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "physical-descriptions",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He spends about fifty thousand primeval stones to bring the lotus to a state he can grab, passes the Moat Gu crystal wall, and refines the rank three flower Gu by leaking a little Spring Autumn Cicada aura. The lotus becomes white blue light and enters his aperture. Without it, the spring’s whirlpools vanish and the water turns into still water with no signs of life.",
        "chapters": [
          182
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuan-obtains-the-lotus",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_spring_autumn_cicada"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Producing stones is only an expression of its innate ability to produce natural primeval essence, which then condenses into stones. It is also called a grass Gu. After refinement, that essence supply is continuous and easy for the owner to use. Fang Yuan does not have to split his attention the way he would when absorbing stones by hand. With a freshly refined rank three copy, his recovery while fighting already reaches a speed comparable to B grade aptitude Gu Masters.",
        "chapters": [
          187
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuan-obtains-the-lotus",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_gu_masters"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "During his earlier rank three period, the Gu again gives him recovery comparable to B grade aptitude Gu Masters, and it keeps resources from being the main limit before rank three again after a later setback. Refining it wasted Gu Yue clan’s foundation spirit spring, with the lotus acting as a miniature portable spirit spring.",
        "chapters": [
          202
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuan-obtains-the-lotus",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Heavenly Essence Treasure Lotus sits with Liquor worm, relic Gu, and related worms under the cultivation category.",
        "chapters": [
          214
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuan-obtains-the-lotus",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_liquor_worm",
          "gu_relic_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable invented Heavenly Essence Treasure Imperial Lotus, a rank six Immortal Gu that produces immortal essence, where the lower ranks of the series produce primeval essence. After his death it was heavily guarded, yet a daring rank seven Gu Immortal who later became Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable stole it, and it was destroyed after that Demon Venerable died. Long Hair Ancestor later succeeded in refining a rank six Heavenly Essence Treasure Imperial Lotus, grew fond of it and advanced it to rank eight; after his death it remained in Lang Ya blessed land.",
        "chapters": [
          463
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "lang-yas-imperial-lotus",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_genesis_lotus_immortal_venerable",
          "sys_gu_immortal",
          "char_thieving_heaven_demon_venerable",
          "char_long_hair_ancestor",
          "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When Fang Yuan offers an Immortal Gu recipe for it, the land spirit refuses at once, saying its immortal essence is how it withstands calamities and tribulations and refines Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          462
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "lang-yas-imperial-lotus",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_recipe"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "With it, Lang Ya blessed land never lacks white litchi immortal essence.",
        "chapters": [
          464
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "lang-yas-imperial-lotus",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "As the killer move Immortal Tribulation Tempering Aperture drains his immortal essence before his tribulation, Fang Yuan is helped by the immortal essence stones he obtained from Lang Ya land spirit and by Heavenly Essence Treasure Imperial Lotus, which he has borrowed.",
        "chapters": [
          1053
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "lang-yas-imperial-lotus",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "move_immortal_tribulation_tempering_aperture",
          "char_lang_ya_land_spirit"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Lang Ya land spirit later offers Heavenly Essence Treasure Imperial Lotus and the incomplete Immortal Gu House Refinement Cauldron for Fang Yuan’s upper extreme heavenly eagle, and Fang Yuan turns the offer down as still not enough.",
        "chapters": [
          1147
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "lang-yas-imperial-lotus",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_immortal_gu_house",
          "house_refinement_cauldron"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Lang Ya blessed land’s Heavenly Essence Treasure Imperial Lotus is not for sale; it had fallen from rank eight to rank seven when Shadow Sect’s invasion damaged it.",
        "chapters": [
          1200
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "lang-yas-imperial-lotus",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_shadow_sect"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Once Fang Yuan has suppressed Lang Ya land spirit, the blessed land’s Immortal Gu belong to him, the rank seven Heavenly Essence Treasure Imperial Lotus among them.",
        "chapters": [
          1758
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "lang-yas-imperial-lotus",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan successfully raises Heavenly Essence Treasure Imperial Lotus back to rank eight.",
        "chapters": [
          2082
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "lang-yas-imperial-lotus",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "At rank eight it had once helped Fang Yuan greatly with immortal essence storage, and it becomes much less useful.",
        "chapters": [
          2215
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "lang-yas-imperial-lotus",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan raises Heavenly Essence Treasure Imperial Lotus to rank nine.",
